@startuml checkpoint-flip
' ============================================================================
' Checkpoint flip — fold the LIVE lock-free overlay into a dense CX image and
' advance the committed-watermark checkpoint_lsn, all under the checkpoint lock.
' Source of truth: src/persistent_artrie/core/overlay/{checkpoint,flip}.rs
' (OverlayCheckpoint::checkpoint_route_split) + core/committed_watermark.rs.
'
' The RES-4 total-loss guard: a checkpoint must capture the OVERLAY (the live
' write target), never an empty / again-evicted tree. Since L3.3 deleted the
' owned tree, route_overlay() is universally true; the guard is the
' debug_assert!(route_overlay()) on entry — modelled here as a guarded
' transition that refuses to publish a degenerate (empty) capture.
'
' Color key (house palette — docs/diagrams/README.md):
'   green  #C8E6C9  serving from the live lock-free overlay (in-memory)
'   amber  #FFF59D  control: the checkpoint lock + watermark advance
'   blue   #BBDEFB  durable on-disk action (write the dense CX image)
'   red    #FFCDD2  the RES-4 total-loss guard (refuse a degenerate capture)
' ============================================================================
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam wrapWidth 240
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #37474F
  FontName "DejaVu Sans"
}

title Checkpoint flip — capture live overlay →\npublish dense CX image → advance checkpoint_lsn

[*] --> Serving

state "Serving (steady state)" as Serving #C8E6C9 {
  [*] --> LiveOverlay
  LiveOverlay : reads traverse the published root
  LiveOverlay : writes = Order-A (WAL append+fsync -> root CAS)
}

Serving --> AcquireLock : checkpoint() requested
state "Acquire checkpoint lock (CK)" as AcquireLock #FFF59D
AcquireLock : serializes concurrent checkpoints
AcquireLock : read committed watermark (Acquire) BEFORE the root load

AcquireLock --> Capture : lock held
state "Capture the LIVE representation" as Capture #C8E6C9
Capture : walk the immutable overlay root
Capture : -> freshly-allocated arena slots (frozen snapshot)
Capture : snapshot is a subset of the committed-durable prefix

' --- RES-4 total-loss guard: refuse to publish a degenerate / empty capture --
Capture --> RES4Guard
state "RES-4 total-loss guard" as RES4Guard #FFCDD2
RES4Guard : debug_assert!(route_overlay())
RES4Guard : the overlay IS the live write target

RES4Guard --> Capture : [empty / again-evicted capture]\nrefuse — would lose every term on reopen
RES4Guard --> PublishImage : [overlay is the live target]\nproceed

state "Publish dense CX image" as PublishImage #BBDEFB
PublishImage : serialize snapshot -> on-disk CX image
PublishImage : RETAIN the WAL (Checkpoint record, no double-count)
PublishImage : eviction-on -> publish-after-verify into the registry

PublishImage --> AdvanceWatermark
state "Advance the checkpoint watermark" as AdvanceWatermark #FFF59D
AdvanceWatermark : record checkpoint_lsn = committed watermark
AdvanceWatermark : raise the commit_seq floor (safe reclaim bound)

AdvanceWatermark --> ReleaseLock
state "Release checkpoint lock" as ReleaseLock #FFF59D

ReleaseLock --> Serving : resume serving\n(reads never blocked on the overlay)

legend right
  | Color | Phase |
  |<#C8E6C9>| serving / live overlay (in-memory) |
  |<#FFF59D>| control: checkpoint lock + watermark |
  |<#BBDEFB>| durable on-disk action (CX image) |
  |<#FFCDD2>| RES-4 total-loss guard |
endlegend
@enduml
